### Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Test Method | Smell | Effort |
|----------|-------------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `addAndDoNothing` | Assertion-Free | Trivial — add one assertion |
| 2 | `addSleepy` | Sleepy Test | Trivial — delete `Thread.sleep` |
| 3 | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Exception Handling | Low — replace with `assertThrows` |
| 4 | `addLoadsFromFile` | Mystery Guest | Low — inline test data |
| 5 | `addConditionalLogic` | Conditional Logic | Low — flatten to straight-line |
| 6 | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Eager Test | Medium — split into 3-4 tests |
| 7 | `toStringFormat` | Sensitive Equality | Low — loosen assertion |
| 8 | `quantityAfterAdds` | Magic Number | Low — name constants |
| 9 | `setUp` / `rng` | General Fixture | Trivial — delete unused field |
